OL,3,GNEWSAFormer day care centre set to be
OL,4,Ademolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe demolition of a former day care
OL,7,Fcentre in Derby has been approved,
OL,8,Fpaving the way for a new facility to be
OL,9,Fbuilt in its place.
OL,11,FThe Morleston Street Day Centre, in
OL,12,FMorleston Street, is set to be
OL,13,Fdemolished after a review by Derby City
OL,14,FCouncil found its condition, layout and
OL,15,Fsuitability ruled out refurbishment as
OL,16,Fa long-term solution.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
