OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAFormer day care centre set to be
OL,4,Ademolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FInitial plans had been for Bonsall View
OL,7,Fto use the existing site for specialist
OL,8,Fcare and support for adults with
OL,9,Flearning disabilities for short
OL,10,Fperiods, on a planned or respite basis,
OL,11,Fto give unpaid carers a break from
OL,12,Ftheir responsibilities.
OL,14,FNow, the council will clear the site
OL,15,Fand build a seven-bed centre in its
OL,16,Fplace.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
